    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nSet on an attractive site extending to approximately 1.2 acres, this traditional four-bedroom cottage/farmhouse offers an excellent opportunity to acquire a country residence in a peaceful and scenic setting.\n\nThe property has been unoccupied for over two years and may qualify for the Vacant Property Refurbishment Grant, subject to the relevant criteria and approvals. This provides an exciting opportunity for a purchaser to restore, upgrade and personalise the home to their own taste.\n\nAccommodation comprises an entrance hallway with side access, a living/sitting room, kitchen, four bedrooms, including one en-suite bedroom, together with a shower room and toilet. The bathroom area has recently been upgraded with new tiling and sanitary ware.\n\nPositioned beneath the impressive backdrop of Mount Nephin, the property enjoys beautiful views across the surrounding countryside and offers the tranquillity of rural living while remaining within a short drive of Crossmolina and its range of shops, schools and local amenities.\n\nWith generous outdoor space and considerable potential, this property would make an ideal family home, countryside retreat or renovation project.\n\nViewing is highly recommended to fully appreciate the setting and potential on offer."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - 0.86m x 10.36m\n\n\nLiving Room - 4.55m x 3.81m\nSolid fuel stove, High timber ceiling, wooden flooing\n\nKitchen - 3.84m x 2.41m\nSolid wooden Fitted units\n\nMaster Bedroom - 3.56m x2.69m\n\n\nEnsuite Bathroom - 2.34m x0.81m\n\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.05m x2.69m\n\n\nBedroom 3 - 3.05m x2.69m\n\n\nBedroom 4 - 4.01m x3.91m\n\n\nMain Bathroom - 1.88m x 2.62m\nWalk in shower, newly tiled with all new sanitary ware. electric shower and shower off mains\n\nGarage - 12.19m x5.18m\n\n\nShed - 3.66m x3.66m\n\n\n"
      },
